OL,3,AFarage says #72m Reform donations are
OL,4,Alegal 'today', as government seeks to
OL,5,Abring in backdated cap
OL,6,
OL,7,F"You cannot confiscate money that has
OL,8,Fbeen given legally within the law as it
OL,9,Fstands," he adds
OL,11,FOver the weekend, Reform announced #36m
OL,12,Fdonations from Christopher Harborne and
OL,13,FBen Delo, who both made money in
OL,14,Fcryptocurrency
OL,16,FReform's deputy leader Richard Tice
OL,17,Fsays his party is "merely trying to get
OL,18,Fon a level playing field"
OL,20,FBut TUC boss Paul Nowak says the
OL,21,Fdonations are a "crisis for our
OL,22,Fdemocracy"
